WEBVTT

00:05.800 --> 00:08.400
I will draft an edict to depose the Crown Prince

00:08.480 --> 00:09.840
To satisfy them

00:11.480 --> 00:12.880
All dismissed for now

00:14.280 --> 00:15.947
Let me have some peace

00:21.800 --> 00:23.200
Yes

00:56.240 --> 00:58.800
Ruolan

01:07.600 --> 01:08.560
Fan Zhong

01:08.720 --> 01:10.640
Have Marquis of Yongning guard the empress's tomb

01:10.720 --> 01:11.920
Your Majesty

01:12.000 --> 01:14.333
Your servant Xie Xuan requests an audience

01:41.680 --> 01:43.840
In the future, Great Xuan will be restored

01:43.920 --> 01:45.587
Lost territories will be recovered

01:46.440 --> 01:47.840
In the history books

01:48.360 --> 01:49.760
Not only brother-in-law

01:49.880 --> 01:51.280
Not only sister

01:52.520 --> 01:55.853
There will also be a record of me, Xie Xuan

02:00.800 --> 02:02.120
Fan Zhong

02:02.200 --> 02:04.200
Bring me a jug of wine

02:22.120 --> 02:23.880
The 21st year of Longwu

02:24.480 --> 02:26.760
Xie Xuan was executed by Emperor Sikong Yao

02:26.840 --> 02:28.680
On charges of persecuting loyal officials

02:28.800 --> 02:30.520
In the capital

02:31.160 --> 02:31.800
At the same time

02:31.920 --> 02:33.200
The emperor also ordered

02:33.320 --> 02:34.520
The Crown Prince

02:34.600 --> 02:36.600
To be confined to the palace

02:40.120 --> 02:41.360
Time is up

02:41.440 --> 02:42.840
Execute

02:43.760 --> 02:45.160
Brother-in-law

02:47.240 --> 02:49.240
Speaking of defeat before the battle

02:49.600 --> 02:52.600
Staying in the capital has made your bones soft

02:55.520 --> 02:56.640
Since we must fight to the death

02:56.720 --> 02:58.720
I won't be such a coward

03:01.760 --> 03:02.760
Brother-in-law

03:02.840 --> 03:05.240
I request to lead the cavalry out of the city

03:05.320 --> 03:06.987
You, as a Xuan person

03:07.800 --> 03:09.800
Acting as a dog under the enemy's tent

03:09.880 --> 03:12.213
Xie Xuan, deputy general of Yiyang garrison

03:12.400 --> 03:13.800
Kill him

03:16.720 --> 03:18.080
One day

03:18.160 --> 03:19.440
Give me one more day

03:19.520 --> 03:21.520
I will personally lead the battle

03:21.920 --> 03:23.280
Under my command

03:23.360 --> 03:25.693
There are also over a hundred men

03:33.280 --> 03:35.840
To clear the way for Your Highness

03:40.000 --> 03:52.000
And this bought sufficient time for the imperial court, holding out until troops were led back to the capital to quell the rebellion.

04:02.880 --> 04:03.800
General Zu

04:03.880 --> 04:05.280
Please rise quickly

04:05.360 --> 04:07.027
You've worked hard, General Zu

04:09.880 --> 04:11.760
I will reward you heavily

04:12.600 --> 04:14.000
Read

04:15.240 --> 04:17.520
General of Agile Cavalry Zu Yue

04:17.800 --> 04:19.280
Loyalty and courage bestowed by heaven

04:19.360 --> 04:20.760
Meritorious achievements are clear

04:20.880 --> 04:22.560
Rescued the emperor and quelled rebellion

04:22.640 --> 04:24.120
Merits surpass all officials

04:24.400 --> 04:24.880
Now

04:25.040 --> 04:26.640
Specially promoted to Grand General

04:27.040 --> 04:29.400
Envoy with credentials, bearer of yellow battle-axe

04:29.640 --> 04:31.480
Commander of all military affairs

04:31.800 --> 04:33.760
Granted the nine bestowments and special honors

04:33.840 --> 04:35.120
May enter court without hurrying

04:35.280 --> 04:36.560
Addressed without name

04:36.640 --> 04:38.280
May enter court with sword and shoes

04:38.360 --> 04:41.360
Opened a government office equal to the Three Excellencies

04:46.200 --> 04:47.320
Your servant Zu Yue

04:47.400 --> 04:49.160
Kowtows in gratitude for the imperial grace
